<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">- Margi Tiwi Ənga Tǝm [mfm]</book>
  <para style="h">Yahwana Nǝ Mǝthlǝkura Nyi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yah Mǝth</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yahwana Nǝ Mǝthlǝkura Nyi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Cama Tsǝtsǝfǝ Nǝ Yahwana</para>
  <para style="mt2">Cama Tsǝtsǝfǝ Nǝ Mǝthlǝu Nǝ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yahwana</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1"/>
  <para style="s">Usa Dzau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1"/>Sara ara ndǝra degal nǝ daɓǝ dzǝ njir nu, a nda nǝ mala dǝgal ki cacaɗau ǝnga wazha nyi kǝra ya vǝr yiwu ǝnga jirkur, aˈyi nayi zhizhi ɗa nga vǝr yiwu nyi mai, ama daɓǝ ǝnga kalar njira wu sǝn jiri. <verse eid="2JN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2"/>ˈYu yiwu hyi arya jirkur kǝra a vǝr nggya wu mǝn ǝnga ju nda nggya wu mǝn baˈanuwa. <verse eid="2JN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3"/>Bǝgǝ mayiwakur, ǝnga tǝhuɗǝu, ǝnga huɗǝ pǝrtu sara ara Hyal Tada ǝnga Yesu Kǝrsiti, Zǝr Tada nyi, nda nggya ǝnga mǝn wu jirkur ǝnga yiwukur.<verse eid="2JN 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4"/>Huɗa yi pipida gagaɗau ǝnga yi thlǝwa alenyi wazha ngau a vǝr nu jiri, ǝnggǝr kǝra Tada cuwa mǝn mǝna mǝl. <verse eid="2JN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5"/>Kabangǝkau, mala dǝgal, vanyi ndǝr mafǝliyangǝ nga ya vǝr tsǝfǝ anǝ ngǝ mai, ama kǝra ara mǝn tsu ɗǝɗǝmǝ ta ngau. Ya vǝr na abǝr, mǝna yiwu kǝrmǝn. <verse eid="2JN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6"/>Ara yiwudzǝ kǝra dudur ca ngǝ mǝna ɓau wu ɓǝlar ndǝr Hyal. Ənggǝr kǝra hyi nggari tsu kaɗǝu, ca ngǝ hya nggya wu yiwukur.<verse eid="2JN 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7"/>Njir sukwa nji gangǝ kǝra gǝra hǝnggǝri abǝr Yesu Kǝrsiti aˈyi shili wu kumǝr dzǝ mai, a tǝtǝlnar nda dzǝ a ndu duniya. Kalar culi najaka nji, njir sukwa nji ngau ǝnga dawa nǝ Kǝrsiti. <verse eid="2JN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8"/>Hya hangǝkal ǝnga kǝrhyi hya sara sana sǝra hyi mǝl thlǝr aga nyi, ama aga hya uya akkǝra nyi. <verse eid="2JN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9"/>Kalar ndǝra cakǝr sau a dar kǝra najaka highiɓau, naja aˈyi taˈyi ar kǝra highiɓǝ nǝ Kǝrsiti mai, Hyal aˈyi ǝnga ja tsu mai, kalar ndǝra dumwa ǝnga highiɓǝ nǝ Kǝrsiti, Tada ǝnga Zǝr nyi aˈyi wu ja. <verse eid="2JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10"/>Kalar ndǝra shili ǝgya hyi, ma aˈyi ji shili ǝnga najaka highiɓǝ mai, hya hǝ nyi a vu kir hyi mai, ǝnga hya sara dlǝwu nyi mai. <verse eid="2JN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11"/>Kalar ndǝra dlǝwur nyi ju nda ɗa wu cir zǝm wu shishikur nyi kau.<verse eid="2JN 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndǝr Nǝ Jomǝndǝl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12"/>Sǝ aˈyi gangǝ kǝra ya kyaga tsǝfǝr hyi, ama nayu yiwu ya ɓǝra tsǝfǝr nda mai, ama arya kau, yu yiwu ya lar hyi bama ǝnga bama aga huɗǝ pipidar mǝn a nyabiya dzau.<verse eid="2JN 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13"/>Wazha kwamǝ ngǝ kǝra cacaɗǝ nda vǝr usa ngau.<verse eid="2JN 1:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1"/>
</usx>
